	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04gym0101_princess3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ショーも　おおづめ　ですけれど
カミツレさまと　おなじ　ステージに▼
たつ　しかくが　あるか
わたくしが　たしかめてさしあげます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:43:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:43:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ショーも　大詰め　ですけれど
カミツレさまと　同じ　ステージに▼
立つ　資格が　あるか
わたくしが　確かめてさしあげます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:43:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:43:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・トレーナー登場メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:43:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>トレーナー
princess_03</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:42:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T06:09:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
